            <h3 class="vibe-text-lg vibe-font-medium vibe-text-foreground vibe-mb-3">Numbers, booleans and other types</h3>
            <p class="vibe-text-muted-foreground vibe-mb-4">
                Any value type binds the same way. With a number or a bool, write the items: an
